kind: stack
title: Layout of an OMF object, first record on top
cell "THEADR"
cell "COMENT" note="Turbo Debugger \"before\" records, for -gtd"
cell "LNAMES" note="\"\", class and segment names, then group names, or DGROUP if none"
cell "COMENT 0x80 0xFE 'F'" note="DWARF in a 32-bit object only: flat addresses"
cell "COMENT 0x00 0xA1 1 'C' 'V'" note="CodeView object only: LINK /CO reads debug info after it"
cell "SEGDEF*" note="one per section, in order"
cell "GRPDEF*"
cell "EXTDEF"
cell "PUBDEF*" note="per segment (a Turbo Debugger type record follows its symbol)"
cell "LEDATA, FIXUPP, LEDATA, FIXUPP ..." note="per section, per span, per 1000-byte chunk"
cell "LINNUM*" note="per segment that has lines"
cell "MODEND"
